      <name>Text Forecast</name>
        <text>Mostly cloudy, with a low around 54. East wind around 5 mph. </text>
        <text>Showers and possibly a thunderstorm between 10am and 4pm, then a chance of showers and thunderstorms after 4pm.  High near 68. Southeast wind 5 to 15 mph becoming southwest in the afternoon. Winds could gust as high as 20 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 90%. New rainfall amounts between a quarter and half of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>A chance of showers, mainly before 10pm.  Mostly cloudy, with a low around 54. West wind 5 to 10 mph becoming light and variable  after midnight.  Chance of precipitation is 50%. New precipitation amounts of less than a tenth of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>Sunny, with a high near 66. Light and variable wind becoming northwest 5 to 10 mph in the afternoon. </text>
        <text>Mostly clear, with a low around 45. East wind around 5 mph. </text>
